VISTA Ultimate - based on Windows Vista Ultimate. Special thanks to Lia and Fabio.

IMPORTANT:
- To see the color in the screenshot, set Windows Live Messenger colorization to the DEFAULT COLOR!
- Please REMOVE older versions before importing this!

What's new in version 1.8.0 ?
+ added new options;
+ multilingual options interface (English, Italian, Spanish, French, Portuguese);
+ added Vista Style Emoticons;
+ replaced some icons;
+ fixed tabbed chats color: now it's light blue, because the text of the tabbed chat can't be colorized;
+ fixed a bug that caused incorrect visualization of some icons on Windows Vista OS.

Ideas for future version:
- minor compatibility with WLM 9.0 BETA

For any suggestion please contact me.

More Info: http://ugosan.spaces.live.com/
